1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,000
Ooh, that does look nice.
噢，那个看起来确实不错。

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,519
Gosh, that's tempting.
哎呀，真让人心动。

3
00:00:04,519 --> 00:00:07,880
I don't often eat ice cream, but they do look really yummy.
我不常吃冰淇淋，但这些看起来真的很好吃。

4
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:18,000
Then they've got coconut bars, pineapple, coconut and lime fruit lollies, and crunchy peanut butter. Hm.
然后还有椰子冰棒、菠萝椰子青柠水果冰棒，以及脆粒花生酱口味。嗯。

5
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,240
Oh, they've got coronation sauce.
噢，这里还有加冕鸡肉沙拉酱。

6
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:44,110
I really love coronation chicken.
我真的很喜欢加冕鸡肉沙拉。

7
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:46,760
So, oh, maybe tempted to take that.
所以，嗯，我有点想带一份走。

8
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:49,240
Will that survive the journey?
它能撑得住这趟旅程吗？

9
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:53,710
Give it a go for £2.
两英镑的话，就试试看吧。

10
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:21,720
M&S are really, really popular for, like, kind of picky bits, and these are really handy.
M&S 的这些零散小食很受欢迎，也很方便。

11
00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:26,750
So you got, like, kind of prawns and tomatoes as a bit of a snack.
比如有虾仁和番茄，可以当点小食。

12
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:29,789
Kind of a Greek salad pot.
还有一小盒希腊沙拉。

13
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:32,760
So it's really nice, kind of like if you want to kind of come here.
所以，如果你想来这里选点吃的，感觉挺不错。

14
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:37,629
I used to come here a lot on my lunch breaks when I worked in the city.
以前在市区工作时，我午休常常来这里。

15
00:01:37,639 --> 00:01:42,270
Pickled cuc—well, pickled cauliflower.
腌黄……嗯，是腌花椰菜。

16
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,919
So yeah, quite a nice selection.
嗯，可选的东西还挺不错。

17
00:01:44,919 --> 00:01:49,400
Used to really like the squid, calamari rings.
我以前很喜欢那个鱿鱼，就是鱿鱼圈。

18
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:54,030
They do, like, a three for £8, which I don't think is too bad.
这里有三份八英镑的组合，我觉得还不错。

19
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,240
Nice little selection.
小食种类还挺丰富。

20
00:01:55,240 --> 00:02:00,349
Fermented kimchi.
发酵泡菜。

21
00:02:00,359 --> 00:02:02,440
Stuffed vine leaves.
有馅的葡萄叶卷。

22
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,920
Bell peppers and cheese.
甜椒和奶酪。

23
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:08,280
So, a good mix, but I think it's not too bad.
搭配挺丰富的，我觉得还不错。

24
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:12,590
It's like 4 pound for one or three for £8.
一份大约四英镑，或者三份八英镑。

25
00:02:14,919 --> 00:02:18,189
If you wanted just a snack.
如果你只是想买点小食的话。

26
00:02:18,229 --> 00:02:20,950
Now this is the naughty section.
好啦，这就是让人忍不住想放纵一下的区域。

27
00:02:20,950 --> 00:02:23,109
All the little kind of sweet treats.
都是这些一小份一小份的甜点。

28
00:02:23,109 --> 00:02:24,390
Chilled sweet treats.
冷藏甜点。

29
00:02:24,390 --> 00:02:26,630
Kind of egg custards.
有蛋奶馅的小甜点。

30
00:02:26,630 --> 00:02:29,830
Oh, double filled lemon eclair.
噢，双份馅料的柠檬闪电泡芙。

31
00:02:29,830 --> 00:02:32,390
Oh my god, that looks good.
天哪，那个看起来真不错。

32
00:02:32,390 --> 00:02:34,380
Chocolate eclair.
巧克力闪电泡芙。

33
00:02:34,390 --> 00:02:38,940
Lemon slices.
柠檬切块蛋糕。

34
00:02:38,950 --> 00:02:43,260
Mm, yum.
嗯，看起来真好吃。

35
00:02:43,270 --> 00:02:46,549
£1.75. That's not that bad.
一英镑七十五便士，倒也不算贵。

36
00:02:46,549 --> 00:02:50,539
Oh, cream donuts. Oh my god.
噢，奶油甜甜圈。天哪。

37
00:02:50,549 --> 00:02:54,460
No. Put them down. Just put them down.
不行，放下吧，赶紧放下。

38
00:02:54,470 --> 00:02:57,950
Fresh strawberry tarts. Mm.
新鲜草莓挞。嗯。

39
00:02:59,109 --> 00:03:07,900
Oh my god. This is not good when you come shopping in M&S for food and you're actually starving and not had anything to eat yet.
天哪，饿着肚子、还什么都没吃就来 M&S 买食物，真是有点招架不住。

40
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:08,510
Crumbs.
哎呀。
